OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster's gains returned to US
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than $650,000 of money confiscated
OL,7,Ffrom a fraudster who had banked it in
OL,8,FJersey has been returned to the
OL,9,FAmerican government.
OL,11,FThe Attorney General has returned
OL,12,F$667,000 (#495,000) to the US
OL,13,FDepartment of Justice from a bank in
OL,14,FJersey where it had been deposited by
OL,15,FGustavo Geraldes, who committed medical
OL,16,Ffraud in the US during the Covid
OL,17,Fpandemic.
OL,19,FGeraldes ran a kickback scheme in which
OL,20,Ftelemedicine providers authorised
OL,21,Funnecessary genetic tests at
OL,22,Flaboratories he part-owned.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
