OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster's gains returned to US
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter his conviction in April 2022, a
OL,7,Fjudgement to surrender $2.64m (#1.96m)
OL,8,Fof proceeds traceable to his crime was
OL,9,Fmade, and funds held in Jersey have
OL,10,Fcontributed towards this total, the Law
OL,11,FOfficers' Department said.
